{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0223_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3f832158ec3593a78103b208aa53be3caa5f04b1dbee91d42b1cb144f7029184", "ja": "（次の公演のプロデュースを、ロコにお願いする\n事になった。これからその打ち合わせだ）", "zh": "（下场公演的制作决定交给ROCO负责。接下来要和对方商量相关事宜了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0223_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "5181c7635057936e5c93106edfe483997f5040640afde9cc51fe330bb889bd0a", "ja": "あ、{$P$}、ナイスタイミングです！\nたった今、ステージプランができたところです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，来得正好！\n舞台方案刚刚完成。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0223_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f490d9129fc5f9fd01d88d5007c7965b5af75e2bddfde46bcda2859478c2d09b", "ja": "おお、もうできたのか。\nどんな感じなんだ？", "zh": "哦，已经完成了吗？\n是什么样的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0223_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "885aa4cd3bcd0285153084c0c8b941c64c687febee8411ddc85b82f471c1ef60", "ja": "テーマはノーブルです！\nアンユージュアルなロコをアピールしますよ♪", "zh": "主题是高贵风格！\n要展现出与众不同的ROCO哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0223_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9aff26584ae2de86205ec15d05a042861ab0c6261ee9a16271b198e381c82ae5", "ja": "なるほど、ノーブル……高貴なお嬢様って\n感じかな？　確かに新しい一面かも。", "zh": "原来如此，是高贵风格……有种高贵大小姐的感觉吗？确实也是崭新的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0223_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "b804b37d99ba4512f27a056570f1ff703ad3a7ec952235b74ec7388685b4adad", "ja": "イグザクトリーです！　さらに、ラグジュアリーな\nステージにするために、バトラーをアサインします！", "zh": "正是如此！而且，为了打造更加奢华的舞台，我还要安排管家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0223_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "d30684c47d8935b353788a423c1655df78c3be0e1281b052db8d96bd131216f6", "ja": "ロコとしては、ジュリアとヤヨイにお願いしたいと\n思っているのですが……大丈夫でしょうか？", "zh": "作为ROCO，我想请茱莉亚和弥生来负责，不过……可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0223_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1dcbf2cec7a17a9170f2c78153b9df1614799c93a2864a32dcee90e502fa4723", "ja": "よし、ふたりに聞いてみようか。\nなかなか面白い企画になりそうだな。", "zh": "好，去问问她们两个人吧。\n感觉会变成一个很有趣的企划呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0223_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "95f9facf426c69279cd6e0e6dffce8a4e2307ce747a5dc71f2795907faf5c013", "ja": "サンクスです！　これでフィックスですね♪\nそれでは、早速レッスンを始めましょう！", "zh": "谢谢啦！　这样就确定了呢♪\n那么，我们马上开始课程吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0223_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "af4e19e9cf72c42274c39bf751b6976edca038b462a53470c3fd0f6eecb7076f", "ja": "{$P$}、\n今日一日、ロコをエスコートしてください！", "zh": "{$P$}，\n请今天一整天陪同ROCO！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0223_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "0407f48a3e9e5b663f2384c330b2c6d9bee871497c8f083d22e5adf2fb493c37", "ja": "今のロコに必要なのは、レディとしてのレッスンです。\nグレイスフルなジェスチャーを身につけたいんです。", "zh": "现在的ROCO需要的是淑女课程。\n我想学会优雅的举止。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0223_1011_p", "source_sha256": "77f9885fee4ff1941ab0694c0b70b54ed0e9f42fdd663b25a9fae34cb5b57ddb", "ja": "なるほど、実践してみようってことだな。\nわかった、俺でよければ手伝うよ。", "zh": "原来如此，也就是说要实际试试看啊。\n明白了，如果你不嫌弃，就由我来帮忙吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0223_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "634d3e0f9ff228eb9ba2dfc0c95e516b1770f89f0e2a82f68c75df2f80fc84b6", "ja": "サンクスです！　では劇場を全部回って、\nそれから駅の方まで行ってみましょう！", "zh": "谢谢啦！　那么我们先把剧场全部逛一遍，\n然后再去车站那边看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0223_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ce0dc3bdea94262f2d4b92badfd8e6b9f8fd1e7d848c332346062ec22a83ea27", "ja": "えっ？　そんなに歩くのか。\nかなりいい運動になりそうだな。", "zh": "诶？要走那么远吗。\n看来会是相当不错的运动啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0223_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "bbe5c71253d50b5259250fa0f62ab6964445145b70d8123924f5c83d7a369796", "ja": "はっ！？　確かに……じゃ、じゃあやっぱり、\nレッスンルームまでにしましょう！", "zh": "哈！？确实……那、那还是到练习室吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0223_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ba053217223707d49141cd0b97922b76dc7bcc266f8892b84809cba7da6be92a", "ja": "えっ……それだと、さすがに近くないか？\nすぐ終わっちゃうけど。", "zh": "诶……那样的话，未免也太近了吧？  \n虽然马上就结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0223_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "cea60af7c9cdf9ca17ff3c35a7fa7079742686df9911f6cb90f5b7c7b8d360f6", "ja": "ううっ……そ、そう、ですよね……。ロコの\nラグジュアリーなステージのためには……。でも……。", "zh": "呜……对、对的……为了ROCO奢华的舞台……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0223_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2e2ec7c8fe1528407e357e4a2276a59705e7eb008ce741e0f028d3c1a7f105dd", "ja": "（ロコが悩み始めてしまった。覚悟がフィックス\nするまで、もう少しかかりそうだな）", "zh": "（ROCO开始烦恼起来了。看来还要再过一阵子，才能下定决心啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
